OVERVIEW: Manage vphone VM bundles

USAGE: vphone-cli vm <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  list                    List VM bundles
  info                    Show one VM bundle
  new                     Create a VM bundle
  config                  Edit VM manifest fields (cpu/memory/network/keyboard)
  bind-core-bundle        Select a verified host Core Bundle for a stopped VM;
                          guest/component origins are preserved
  rename                  Rename a VM bundle
  delete                  Delete a VM bundle
  clone                   Clone a stopped VM bundle, preserving its device
                          identity and boot state
  export                  Export a VM bundle to a compressed archive (.tzst
                          fast / .txz max)
  import                  Import a VM bundle from a .tzst/.txz archive
  launch                  Boot a VM bundle (runs host preflight first)
  stop                    Stop a running VM bundle
  create                  Create a VM end-to-end (prepare → patch → restore →
                          CFW → first boot)
  create-status           Show the create checkpoint of a VM (read-only)

  See 'vphone-cli help vm <subcommand>' for detailed help.
